<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n73691" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμοιό-τροπος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of like manners and life,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				487b27
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Ir.</u>
				p.30
			</span></i> W. ; simply, <i>similar,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυνάμεις τῆς φράσεως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Pomp.</u>
					3
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰτίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.259
				</span></i>
			 ; of animals, <i><span class="en">
				Agatharch.
				1
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πως</span>
			<i>in like fashion</i> or <i>manner with,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				755b28
			</span></i>, al. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὶ ὁ. διατεθῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1.153
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i> : neut. pl. as Adv., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁμοιότροπα τῷ νῦν βαρβαρικῷ
					διαιτᾶσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>conformable,</i>
			<i>having similar effects,</i> of medicines, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				23
			</span></i>.</div>
